     "shortDescription": {
      "@en": "In the heart of Old Annecy, the district of the manufacture recalls the existence of an important cotton factory which was the center of an important textile complex founded at the beginning of the 19th century by a Savoyard industrialist, Jean-Pierre Duport.",
      "@fr": "Au cœur du Vieil Annecy, le quartier de la manufacture rappelle l'existence d'une importante manufacture de coton qui était le centre d'un important ensemble textile fondé au début du 19e siècle par un industriel savoyard, Jean-Pierre Duport."
     }
    }
   ],
